#: src/routes/HowToPlay.tsx:3060
msgid "Building on the river pays <0>coins</0>. A road on a river edge pays 1, a settlement on a river intersection pays 1, and a bridge pays <1>3</1>. Upgrading a settlement to a city pays nothing: the intersection has already been paid for. A piece placed for free still pays, because the coin is for the placement and not for the price."
